PACKAGE LOCATION: diskx6
PACKAGE DESCRIPTION:
xextra:   Two optional experimental servers for X11R6.
xextra:
xextra:   Xvfb -- a virtual framebuffer X server. Xvfb is an X server that can
xextra:   run on machines with no display hardware and no physical input 
xextra:   devices.  It emulates a dumb framebuffer using virtual memory.
xextra:
xextra:   Xnest -- a nested X server.  Xnest is a client of the real server
xextra:   which manages windows and graphics requests on its behalf.  Xnest is a
xextra:   server to its own clients.  Xnest manages windows and graphics 
xextra:   requests on their behalf.
xextra:
